 102:     - Complete the red outline at one-cell top-left diagonal closures of the filled rim.
 103: 
 104:     Key insight:
 105:     - The task is not filling whole regions; it labels the two sides of each closed rim, while open blue objects have no enclosed hole and stay unchanged.
